\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Operation \highlight\uc2  kill the ruble: new record in its exchange rate against the dollar\b0\par\par\uc2 521 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has depreciated 16% against the U.S. dollar since its 2021 peak and set a record low of 0.0118 dollars on Thursday. That is, one dollar was exchanged for 89.60 rubles: something unprecedented.\par \par \uc2 On December 15, 2014, with the first international sanctions in force for the annexation of Crimea, the ruble plummeted in its cross against the dollar and broke a record: one dollar was exchanged for 60 rubles. A figure that was considered "a psychological barrier" for the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as Steve Rosenberg, the BBC's Moscow correspondent, wrote at the time.\par \par \uc2 This Thursday, that record was buried. The Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a new all-time low, exchanging one dollar for 89.60 rubles, prompting \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to say it would "\b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and provide additional liquidity to the banking sector," CNN Business reported. By Friday afternoon, one dollar was worth 83 rubles; in other words, one ruble exchanged for 0.012 dollars and 0.010 euros.\par \par \uc2 Stemming the depreciation Destroying the ruble seems to be the goal of international sanctions, imposing restrictions on trade and financial transactions. "Should the ruble relatively quickly reach and exceed 100 against the dollar, the possibility of a rate hike could come into play," \uc2 Piotr Matys\uc2 , a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at London-based InTouch Capital Markets, said in remarks picked up by \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  this week.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  options see a greater than 50% chance of the ruble reaching 100 to the dollar in the second quarter," according to data compiled by the economic information agency.\par \par \uc2 Matys assured that "monetary \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the first line of defense and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has accumulated significant \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves that allow it to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the pace of ruble depreciation."\par \par \uc2 As for sanctions, another flank that could be targeted is Russian exports of gas, oil, wheat and other raw materials, such as nickel: Russia is one of the largest exporters of this mineral, with a global market share of 49%, KPMG's Metals & Mining in Russia report revealed in 2016. Palladium's market share was 42% then; diamonds, 33%; aluminum, 26%; platinum, 13%; and steel, 7%.\par \par \uc2 Some of those metals are going to Germany, a country to which Russia exported $18.9 billion in 2019 and from which it imported $30 billion, according to the Observatory of Economic Complexity (OEC), a project that emerged from MIT. Russia's main trading partners that year were China, the Netherlands, Belarus, Germany and Italy.\par \par \uc2 The link between Moscow and Beijing cannot be overlooked. Last year, Russia communicated that it was going to reduce the dollar assets of its sovereign wealth fund and instead invest in euro, yuan and gold assets. At the same time and for the first time, more than three quarters of Russia's trade with China was settled in euros. And also in 2021, Vasily Zablotsky, chairman of the Russian banks lobby confirmed to Reuters that Russia could issue OFZ government bonds denominated in Chinese yuan in two years.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220226ei2p002q2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
