\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Dollar trades downward after sharp rise on Ukraine invasion\b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The dollar started trading lower this Friday after the considerable rise it suffered in reaction to the invasion of Russian troops into Ukrainian territory.After having reached a selling peak of $820.10 last day, the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened this Friday with a decrease of $5.10 to settle at $815.The trend has continued and the greenback reached a peak of $810.63 shortly before 9:00 am. Ricardo Bustamante, head of trading studies at Capitaria, explained to Diario Financiero that "the dollar's price has shown little movement this day, after yesterday's strong impulse, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of emerging economies suffered important falls due to the escalation of tensions between Russia and Ukraine". He also accused that "any indication of further attacks by \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Ukrainian soil and/or war \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by other world powers could support a strong advance of the greenback in our country".\par \par \uc2  While Juan Ortiz, from XTB Latam, pointed out in Emol that the market "is acting a little more positively after \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  indicated that he is willing to negotiate with Ukraine, while the United States continues to apply economic sanctions against Russia". The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  convened a meeting of the \uc2 Financial Stability Board (FSB) \uc2 Financial Stability Board\uc2  (FSB) to analyze the economic consequences of the war between Ukraine and Russia. In addition to the Minister of Finance, Rodrigo Cerda, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Financial Market Commission (CMF) and the Superintendence of Pensions have been summoned to the meeting.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220225ei2p006hf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
