le. A rapidly depreciating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  makes it harder to pay off foreign debts and leads to higher prices on imported goods.\par \par \uc2 Write to Caitlin Ostroff at caitlin.ostroff@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 February 24, 2022 02:26 ET (07:26 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020220224ei2o000p4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
