\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 After vaccine diplomacy, a delegation of 38 Russian businessmen arrives to explore investments and financing\b0\par\par\uc2 915 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 November 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 On December 9, 2020, the Government signed the contract with the Russian Sovereign Direct Investment Fund (RDIF) to receive 30 million doses of Sputnik V. The administration of \uc2 Alberto Fernandez\uc2  thus opened the doors of Latin America to the vaccine produced by the Gamaleya Institute and was the second country outside Russia to approve it.\par \par \uc2 Now, exactly one year later and when the Argentine government is more worried about the shortage of stocks than about the coronavirus, 38 representatives of important Russian companies will arrive in Argentina.\par \par \uc2 From December 6 to 10, executives from banks, financial, transportation, mining, tourism and energy companies will meet with President \uc2 Alberto Fernandez\uc2  and his economic team and explore possible investments in the country. Financing and the placement of bonds are also an option in the face of the lack of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The main responsible for the arrival of the contingent of potential Russian investors is Cecilia Nicolini. The President's international advisor, who has an office on the second floor of the Casa Rosada, established a close and trusting relationship with the representatives of the RDIF to close the agreement for the vaccines against Covid-19.\par \par \uc2 It was not interrupted even when the e-mail that the official wrote to Anatoly Braverman, right-hand man of the Fund's CEO, \uc2 Kirill Dmitriev\uc2 , to complain about the postponed shipment of the second component of the vaccine, was made public. "The entire contract is at risk of being publicly cancelled," Nicolini said in the letter, which was published by Carlos Pagni in La Naci\u243\'00\'F3n.\par \par \uc2 In the end, the contract was not only not cancelled; the Russian authorities ended up accepting the doses produced by Richmond Pharmaceuticals in Pilar, another of the presidential advisor's demands. Now a new financial and commercial chapter is opening between the Kremlin and the Casa Rosada.\par \par \uc2 Alberto Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez and his Russian counterpart, \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 , last spoke by telephone on Nov. 11. "They confirmed their mutual intention to strengthen Russian-Argentine strategic cooperation and practical cooperation in various fields," an airtight official Kremlin statement said at the time.\par \par \uc2 The Argentine president, along with Foreign Minister Santiago Cafiero and the ministers of Economy, \uc2 Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Guzm\u225\'00\'E1n\uc2 , and of Productive Development, \uc2 Mat\u237\'00\'EDas Kulfas\uc2 , among others, will receive the large delegation at the Bicentennial Museum, in the basement of the Casa Rosada.\par \par \uc2 Dmitriev and Braverman, the addressee of Nicolini's letter, will be there. In addition, there will be three representatives of \uc2 Sovcombank\uc2 , one of the most important private banks of the Eurasian giant; two financial services companies -Quiwi PLC, which offers direct payment services such as Mercado Pago, and RTP Global, which finances technological ventures in Europe, India and the United States.\par \par \uc2 The presence of the financial companies fuels reports that the government is seeking new avenues of direct financing from \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  or China. These rumors grew after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 Miguel Pesce\uc2 , who days ago during the Monetary and Banking 2021 conference pointed out that it is necessary to explore "bilateral assistance mechanisms through central banks and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap mechanisms".\par \par \uc2 Pesce's words were relativized through a statement from the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  so as not to hinder the government's negotiations with the \uc2 IMF\uc2 , where the United States has a majority on the board.\par \par \uc2 The president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will also hold meetings with the Russian envoys in which will also participate Lisandro Cleri - Guzman's man, in charge of the Sustainability Guarantee Fund of ANSES, through which the Argentine State has shares in some of the most important private companies in the country, a legacy of the nationalization of the AFJP.\par \par \uc2 In 2014, the then head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Alejandro Vanoli, analyzed the possibility of a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap with Russia similar to the one Argentina signed with China, originally signed by \uc2 Cristina Kirchner\uc2  and extended by \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2  and Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez. The agreement with Moscow never materialized.\par \par \uc2 The delegation will also include representatives of the Russian flag carrier \uc2 Aeroflot\uc2 , fertilizer companies, tourism, gas explorers and developers of clean and conventional energy.\par \par \uc2 In addition, transport giants such as the state-owned railway giant Russian Railways and \uc2 Transmashholding\uc2 , Russia's largest producer of rolling stock for railways and urban transport systems, will also be present. Representatives of the steel manufacturer \uc2 Severstal\uc2 , which in partnership with \uc2 Tenaris\uc2  (Techint) builds pipes in Siberia, will also be present.\par \par \uc2 A separate paragraph -perhaps the most outstanding- is the mining chapter of the mission. Revitalizing this sector, which generates foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  (but is criticized by environmentalists) is one of the big bets of the Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez administration. The delegation will include executives from Solway (based in Switzerland) and Aterra Capital, two companies that in 2019 discontinued their investments in Uspallata (Mendoza) to extract gold and copper.\par \par \uc2 The entire \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  was estimated at US$ 600 million. Now, businessmen and local authorities will visit that province and San Juan, where they will summon ministers and secretaries of the sector.\par \par \uc2 From the Rosada insist that they also intend to convene opposition leaders to skip the rift. "They are strategic investments for the country, not for the government," explained an important government official.\par \par \uc2 Because of the pandemic, the Russian trade mission only has as a precedent in the management of Fernandez the arrival of Spanish businessmen who accompanied the Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez last June. Now they are excited about more concrete announcements.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020211128ehbr0005x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
