\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Turkey's lira falls past 8 per dollar;  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 , stocks eye 6th week of gains\b0\par\par\uc2 556 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Dezember 2020\par 11:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * Turkey's lira tumbles on U.S. sanction threat\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 EU\uc2  extends sanctions on Russia by another six months\par \par \uc2 * Sri Lankan dollar bonds slide after S&P rating cut\par \par \uc2 By Shashank Nayar and Sruthi Shankar\par \par \uc2 Dec 11 (Reuters) - The Turkish lira hit a two-week low versus the dollar on Friday on a threat of U.S. sanctions, while emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stocks were set for their sixth straight week of gains on global economic recovery hopes.\par \par \uc2 The lira weakened 1.5% to trade past 8.00 per dollar at one point after sources told Reuters the United States is poised to impose sanctions on Turkey over its purchase of Russian S-400 air defence systems last year.\par \par \uc2 The long-anticipated step, which is likely to infuriate Ankara and severely complicate relations with the incoming administration of President-elect \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , could be announced any day, the sources said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was last traded at 7.9717 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 "The sanctions are expected to target Turkey's Presidency of Defence Industries and its head Ismail Demir, which is on the mild end of the spectrum (not surprising given Trump's reluctance to impose sanctions on Turkey in the past)," \uc2 Elsa Lignos\uc2 , RBC Capital Market's global head of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy, wrote in a note.\par \par \uc2 Lignos added that the lira's negative reaction has been contained, with the decision left pending for Biden who could impose stronger sanctions.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 European Union\uc2  leaders have agreed to prepare limited sanctions on Turkish individuals over an energy exploration dispute with Greece and Cyprus.\par \par \uc2 The lira has been among the worst performing EM \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year as concerns over depleted foreign reserves and high inflation have overshadowed President \uc2 Tayyip Erdogan\uc2 's rhetoric of market-friendly reforms.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lagged its EM peers, which were on course for a small but sixth straight week of gains thanks to a faltering dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Russian rouble slipped on the day even as Brent crude futures rallied past $50 a barrel. Russia is among the world's top three oil nations.\par \par \uc2 EU\uc2  leaders were set to extend economic sanctions imposed on \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  for its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Ukraine by another six months.\par \par \uc2 Eastern European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  including the Hungarian forint and Polish zloty fell against the euro which firmed after the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unveiled fresh stimulus measures on Thursday broadly in line with expectations.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Sri Lanka's sovereign dollar bonds fell after rating agency S&P slashed the country's credit rating to "CCC+/C", citing concerns that risks to the island nation's debt servicing capacity have risen.\par \par \uc2 The MSCI's EM equities index was set to for a 0.6% weekly gain lifted by record gains for Asian stocks on optimism over faster economic rebound in the region and encouraging COVID-19 vaccine developments.\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance in 2020, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh}}}\uc2  For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance in 2020, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX}}}\par \par \uc2 For TOP NEWS across emerging markets\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see (Reporting by Shashank Nayar and Sruthi Shankar in Bengaluru; Editing by Amy Caren Daniel) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-12-11T11:14:45.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020201211egcb01ln1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
