\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Oil prices lift Russian rouble as chaos in Belarus intensifies; Lira down\b0\par\par\uc2 550 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 2020\par 11:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * Lira slips 0.2% against weaker dollar\par \par \uc2 * Belarus dollar denominated bonds fall\par \par \uc2 * Poland to discuss situation in Belarus with opposition; zloty up\par \par \uc2 * Hungarian forint flat; cenbank decision on Tuesday eyed\par \par \uc2 * EM stocks up on COVID-19 treatment optimism, upbeat U.S data\par \par \uc2 By Susan Mathew\par \par \uc2 Aug 24 (Reuters) - Turkey's lira extended losses on Monday after ratings agency Fitch lowered the country's outlook to 'negative', while Belarus bonds fell as protests demanding leader \uc2 Alexander Lukashenko\uc2  step down intensified.\par \par \uc2 Emerging market stocks jumped 1% after the \uc2 U.S. Food and Drug Administration\uc2  approved the use of a recovered COVID-19 patent's blood plasma as a treatment option, while upbeat business surveys from the United States kept hopes for an economic recovery alive.\par \par \uc2 The dollar weakened against most rivals ahead of the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 's annual Jackson Hole gathering on Thursday, where Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  is expected to talk about the bank's monetary policy framework review.\par \par \uc2 In Turkey, Fitch changed its outlook to 'negative' from 'stable' on Friday, citing depleting \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, weak monetary policy credibility and a sizeable current account deficit among factors exacerbating external financing risks.\par \par \uc2 The lira fell 0.2%. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , down 19% this year, has been plumbing new lows recently, but found some footing last week after a significant gas find in the Black Sea.\par \par \uc2 The news, which was later confirmed by President \uc2 Tayyip Erdogan\uc2 , would lessen the country's energy imports and help narrow its current account deficit.\par \par \uc2 South Africa's rand rose 1.1% to hit a three-week high, extending gains to a fifth straight session, while higher oil prices lifted Russia's rouble from over three-month lows even as chaos in neighbouring Belarus rose.\par \par \uc2 Tens of thousands of citizens flooded into Minsk to protest a disputed presidential election earlier this month. Russia on Friday had said it was ready to help Belarus if asked.\par \par \uc2 "If there is an escalation and \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is asked to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , that would be very negative for Russian assets. Not immediately or directly, but through sanctions imposed by Western diplomacies," said \uc2 Cristian Maggio\uc2 , head of EM strategy at \uc2 TD Securities\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "In that case, it would be negative for the rouble even beyond any positive moves for oil."\par \par \uc2 Yields on Belarus 2030 dollar-denominated bonds rose, while prices of Belarussian dollar-denominated debt broadly fell, across different maturities. ,.\par \par \uc2 Poland's government will discuss the situation in its eastern neighbour as it sees no quick end to the situation, the Prime Minster said. Against a stronger euro, the Polish zloty rose 0.2%.\par \par \uc2 Hungary's forint was flat against the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  interest rate meeting on Tuesday. After 15-basis-point cuts in the last two months, the bank is expected to stand pat, a Reuters poll showed.\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance 2020, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh}}}\uc2  For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance 2020, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX}}}\par \par \uc2 For TOP NEWS across emerging markets\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Susan Mathew in Bengaluru; Editing by Amy Caren Daniel) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-8-24T10:09:41.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200824eg8o018r5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
