\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russian rouble firms away from 80 versus dollar, stocks up\b0\par\par\uc2 517 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2020\par 18:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, detail, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, March 31 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble firmed on Tuesday, feeling support from \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and moving away from levels of 80 against the dollar hit the previous day when oil prices slid, while stock indexes inched higher.\par \par \uc2 At 1606 GMT, the rouble was 2% stronger against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 77.73, having hit 80.85 on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The rouble weakened to as much as 81.97 in mid-March, a level last seen in early 2016, and is one of the worst-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar so far this year.\par \par \uc2 Having lost more than 20% of its value in 2020 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/rngs/GLOBAL-CURRENCIES-PERFORMANCE/0100301V041/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://fingfx.thomsonreuters.com/gfx/rngs/GLOBAL-\b  \highlight22CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight22 -PERFORMANCE/0100301V041/index.html}}}\uc2 , the weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  together with low oil prices and the coronavirus outbreak is seen pushing the Russian commodity-dependent economy into recession this year.\par \par \uc2 Russia has reported 2,337 cases and 17 deaths as of Tuesday, and says the virus has spread to 73 of its more than 80 regions.\par \par \uc2 Versus the euro, the rouble gained 2.3% to 85.65 , moving away from its weakest since early 2016 of 89.60 seen on March 19.\par \par \uc2 The rouble is receiving some support from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that started selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from its reserves in March for the first time since early 2015.\par \par \uc2 In the past few days, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was selling around 13.3 billion roubles ($168.76 million) worth of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  a day.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will increase support to the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  given current oil prices," said Andrey Kadulin, an analyst at Bank St Petersburg.\par \par \uc2 "Risks of a new sell-off wave remain in place but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's support may keep the rouble from substantial weakening."\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, oil recovered some ground after U.S. President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and Russian President \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  agreed to talks to stabilise energy markets, with benchmarks climbing off 18-year lows hit as the coronavirus outbreak cut fuel demand worldwide.\par \par \uc2 Brent crude oil, a global benchmark for Russia's main export, was up 0.2% at $22.80 a barrel after falling as low as $21.65 on Monday.\par \par \uc2 From a technical analysis point of view, the dollar may see support at 77 roubles and resistance at 80, Alor Brokerage said in a note.\par \par \uc2 "But the current exchange rate is not a market one as relative stability of the rouble is the implication of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Alor said.\par \par \uc2 Russian stock indexes were higher.\par \par \uc2 The dollar-denominated RTS index finished the day up 5.8% at 1,014.4 points. The rouble-based MOEX Russian index climbed 3.1% to 2,508.8 points, well below its all-time high of 3,226.89 hit in January.\par \par \uc2 For Russian equities guide see\par \par \uc2 For Russian treasury bonds see ($1 = 78.8080 roubles) (Additional reporting by Vladimir Abramov; Editing by Kirsten Donovan and Ken Ferris) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-3-31T17:27:27.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200331eg3v03sfe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
